      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I am having the same issue trying to upgrade from 3.5 to 3.7.1 ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Is there a new release where this bug fix has been integrated? Or what am I supposed to do to work around this?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
